WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:06.319
Giyu from Demon Slayer is an insanely powerful
swordsman who HATES demons.

00:00:06.319 --> 00:00:10.900
But what if somehow he was suddenly turned
into a demon himself.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.070
How strong would he be?

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:17.960
And how would his transformation COMPLETELY
change the story?

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.980
And we have to begin all the way back in episode
one where Giyu ABSOLUTELY MUST still be a

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.980
human.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:29.680
Because honestly if Giyu isn’t here to save
Tanjiro from his demon sister, then the main

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:35.350
character would probably have died right here
and the story would be over.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:41.850
So let’s assume that this all stays the
same and Giyu sends Tanjiro to meet with this

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.550
former Water Hashira to begin his training.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:50.140
Now you may not remember, but Tanjiro spent
about TWO WHOLE YEARS training here, so this

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:56.469
is THE PERFECT time period for Giyu’s unfortunate
transformation., and is going to perfectly

00:00:56.469 --> 00:01:03.360
set up the HEART-BREAKING final battle involving
Demon Giyu, Tanjiro, and two other Hashira.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:08.409
So let’s imagine that Giyu somehow runs
into the Demon King Muzan and he would of

00:01:08.409 --> 00:01:12.530
course get CRUSHED if he even decided to fight
at all.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:17.400
But let’s assume Muzan doesn’t want to
waste such a powerful fighter so he offers

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.420
to change Giyu into a demon.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:29.400
Now I have to say that there is ABSOLUTELY
NO CHANCE that Giyu would choose to become.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:34.260
I mean he would literally kill his friends
if they were to become demons, but for the

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:40.049
sake of this scenario let’s say that Muzan
forces him to transform.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:45.090
Which would be COMPLETE TORTURE for Giyu,
but he would definitely survive and likely

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:48.270
try to hold onto his memory of Tanjiro and
Nezuko.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:53.540
That’s because he might think that if Nezuko
can survive without eating humans then he

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:56.149
should be able to as well.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.149
Right?

00:01:57.149 --> 00:02:02.240
But Muzan would probably anticipate this,
so during the roughly two to three days this

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:08.330
transformation is happening the demon king
is going to do two things, one of which is

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.420
completely messed up.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:16.050
First he takes Giyu to some place where he
cannot kill himself by going out into the

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.050
sun.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:21.510
Say somewhere like the infinity castle where
he is completely under Muzan’s control.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:26.870
And second Muzan sends one of the higher ranking
Upper Moon demons to kidnap Giyu’s former

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.580
mentor, Urokodaki, to take him hostage.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:34.730
Now you might be thinking “well wait, wasn’t
Tanjiro still training?”

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:39.110
but let’s say this happens while Tanjiro
is away taking his Final Selection test.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:44.370
And while Urokodaki is strong and he would
probably kill himself before being taken captive,

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:48.750
let’s assume that he is knocked unconscious
and then taken back to Muzan.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:55.300
Now this means that on top of being WILDLY
HUNGRY after his demon transformation, Giyu

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.430
now has his mentor to worry about too.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:04.090
And I think all of this pressure will eventually
lead him to break down, forget his desire

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:08.650
to remain a good demon like Nezuko, and finally
eat a human to stay alive.

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:14.240
Which is going to alter his normally bland
personality somewhat PLUS now that he’s

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:18.160
a demon we have to ask the MOST IMPORTANT
question.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.880
How powerful is Demon Giyu?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.980
Well of course he will have the ridiculous
strength, endurance, and healing that all

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.490
powerful demons possess.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.200
But how about his blood demon art?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.620
And his new demonic appearance?

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:36.140
Well, keep watching to see his INSANE design
and new powers, but we first must discuss

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:39.620
how his transformation is going to change
the story.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:44.620
Because remember that this is all happening
while Tanjiro is taking his final selection

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.620
exam.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.569
So when he is ready to fully join the demon
slayers he is going to have a MASSIVE SHOCK

00:03:49.569 --> 00:03:55.650
when he learns the HORRIBLE FATE of the only
two demon slayers he really knows.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.970
Talk about a rough start to a new job.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.239
Now there are a few things that could happen
next.

00:04:01.239 --> 00:04:06.450
Tanjiro might be desperate to try and save
them, but honestly he is nowhere near strong

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:11.250
enough to attempt any sort of rescue, so for
now the story will progress as normal.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:16.489
That means Tanjiro will still go to Mount
Natagumo to fight the spider demon family,

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:21.340
but instead of Giyu showing up to rescue it
will probably be someone else like the Flame

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:26.110
Hashira Rengoku, who should be strong enough
to easily take out the Lower Rank Five Demon.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:30.150
And while we’re talking about the Hashira,
I think it is fair to assume that the other

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:36.150
Hashira will NOT take the news about Giyu’s
transformation well AT ALL.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:40.780
Some of them like the Wind Hashira Sanemi
and the Serpent Hashira Obanai will probably

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.400
even want to go hunt him down IMMEDIATELY.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:48.470
And speaking of Demon Giyu, I already mentioned
that eating humans for the first time would

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:53.039
probably change his personality, so at this
point he would probably be losing his grip

00:04:53.039 --> 00:04:58.080
on his humanity and be out hunting down humans
and eating them to grow stronger.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:04.380
So there is a decent chance that the Hashira
could find Giyu somewhere, but for now let’s

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.940
assume that he avoids fighting against any
of the strongest demon slayers.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:12.940
Which defintely won’t last forever, as we’ll
see in just a few moments.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:18.160
Now there’s one other disclaimer I have
to mention and that is because as a Hashira

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:25.100
Giyu would probably know a TON of super secret
information that Muzan would love to get his

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.100
hands on.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:30.729
For example, the location of the Demon Slayer
Corps Headquarters or the swordsmith village,

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:34.710
but for this scenario let’s assume that
Demon Giyu has lost some of his memories because

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:40.430
it would basically be the end of the demon
slayers if Muzan had that information at this

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:41.940
time.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:48.039
While months pass and Demon Giyu grows stronger,
Tanjiro goes on his missions, nearly dies

00:05:48.039 --> 00:05:51.370
multiple times, and spends a ton of time recovering.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:56.370
At the end of all this, Giyu would probably
have already climbed the ranks of the Lower

00:05:56.370 --> 00:06:00.539
Moon Demons and be ready to challenge for
the top six spots.

00:06:00.539 --> 00:06:05.860
That’s because even though he has only had
a few months to master his new body and skills,

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:12.990
we know that insanely strong humans usually
turn into insanely strong demons with more

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:18.210
of Muzan’s blood, so now Demon Giyu is ready
to make a push to become an Upper Moon ranked

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.210
demon.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:23.960
Now in case you don’t know, there isn’t
some special tournament or something that

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:25.970
the demons use to rank themselves.

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:30.190
Instead, a demon can only become ranked by
earning Muzan’s favor.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:37.810
And the best way to do that is to do something
extraordinary or to just be super powerful.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:43.470
So to do this let’s say that instead of
just killing hundreds of people Giyu tricks

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.889
someone like the Upper Moon 5 demon Gyokko
into a fight.

00:06:46.889 --> 00:06:52.419
Now we know that demons can’t usually kill
each other and they don’t often fight, but

00:06:52.419 --> 00:06:56.350
it does happen from time to time because we
were told in a fan book that the Upper Moon

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.690
Three has challenged the Upper Moon One multiple
times.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:05.430
So let’s just imagine that Giyu insults
Gyokko’s creepy artwork or something and

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.860
they square off to fight.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:16.979
Which means it is FINALLY TIME to see what
he looks like AND his new powers in action.

00:07:16.979 --> 00:07:23.260
This is his new demon form which is mostly
his same human form with a few incredible

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.449
changes.

00:07:24.449 --> 00:07:30.080
First he has these icy-blue lines that cover
parts of his body like cracked ice.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:35.120
He still uses a sword, but we’ll see what
kind of new blade he has in just a moment.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:39.229
Then to cap it all off he has this long, dragon-like
tail.

00:07:39.229 --> 00:07:44.360
And we’re going to see his new powers in
action right away because when Gyokko unleashes

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:50.190
thousands of demon fish at Giyu, the Hashira
Demon pulls out his sword and the entire group

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.460
of fish instantly freezes.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:57.949
And I mean they literally freeze because Giyu’s
blade is actually an ice-sword made from his

00:07:57.949 --> 00:07:59.250
blood demon art.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:04.379
That’s because I combined his normally chilly
personality with his Water Breathing form

00:08:04.379 --> 00:08:08.860
to create an ice-blood demon art which allows
him to freeze things.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:14.190
Which is going to be super effective against
Gyokko because Giyu can even make it so cold

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:17.870
that it can somewhat freeze the blood in the
Upper Moon Five’s body.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:23.639
So with this the former Hashira slices through
Gyokko’s body and easily puts an end to

00:08:23.639 --> 00:08:24.639
the duel.

00:08:24.639 --> 00:08:28.849
Which certainly will be enough to earn Muzan’s
favor and promote Giyu into Gyokko’s spot

00:08:28.849 --> 00:08:30.430
as the Upper Moon five.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:35.010
But before Giyu leaves, he makes Gyokko reveal
the location of the Swordsmith Village.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:39.219
Now, if you are caught up with the anime then
you might be able to predict where this is

00:08:39.219 --> 00:08:40.310
going next.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:44.110
Because while Tanjiro has been off fighting
on the Mugen train and in the Entertainment

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:48.490
District, he has broken his sword which means
he is off to the Swordsmith Village for a

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.630
new one.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:56.370
And all is going well at first, but after
a few nights here things start to get chilly.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:09:00.959
Because in the original story, the Upper Moon
Four Demon and Gyokko attacked the village

00:09:00.959 --> 00:09:04.060
with the help of all these creepy fish demons.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:09.110
But in this version, Gyokko is replaced by
Demon Giyu, so instead of the creepy fish,

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.779
we just have a bunch of random weaker demons
instead.

00:09:12.779 --> 00:09:18.829
But this invasion sends the demon slayers
into battle including Tanjiro, Genya, the

00:09:18.829 --> 00:09:22.710
Mist Hashira Muichiro, and eventually the
Love Hashira Mitsuri.

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:28.370
And hold onto your seats because in this battle
we are going to see ONE FINAL BETRAYAL that

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.519
will absolutely crush your heart.

00:09:30.519 --> 00:09:34.311
And if you want more Demon Slayer Content
just like this, make sure to subscribe to

00:09:34.311 --> 00:09:35.311
the channel.

00:09:35.311 --> 00:09:39.649
Let’s kick it off with the first major change
to this arc.

00:09:39.649 --> 00:09:43.269
Since there is no Gyokko in this battle, when
Muichio sprints back to the village after

00:09:43.269 --> 00:09:48.120
being blasted away, he isn’t going to be
stopped by the former Upper Moon Five.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:53.090
That means he can basically head straight
back to help Genya and Tanjiro face off against

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:56.620
the Upper Moon 4 Hantengu and his split personalities.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:00.630
Which means that when Mitsuri finally arrives
back in the village, she’ll still be able

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:05.170
to slice through the weaker demons until she
reaches the village chief.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:10.800
But this time instead of being crushed by
a giant fish, the village chief is already

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:11.870
dead…

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:14.980
And as she sees this Mitsuri’s skin starts
to shiver.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:20.330
That’s because standing over the village
chief’s body is Demon Giyu with his icy

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.940
sword covered in blood.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:26.170
And this is going to send Mitsuri ABSOLUTELY
FURIOUS.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:30.230
Because while I don’t think she would have
been one of the Hashira who originally wanted

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:34.970
to hunt Giyu down, at this point there is
no turning back for the former demon.

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:40.890
Which is truly heart-breaking because Mitsuri
used to think Giyu was pretty timid and adorable,

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:43.670
but now she is determined to cut him down.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:48.490
But first, Giyu’s dragon-like tail shoots
out and smacks Mitsuri.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:53.519
Then the furious Hashira rushes Giyu with
her whip-like swords flashing in a million

00:10:53.519 --> 00:10:54.970
different directions.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:59.670
But before we see EPIC end of this fight,
first we have to say that on the other side

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:04.410
of the village, the fight against the Upper
Moon Four is going WAY SMOOTHER than in the

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:05.560
original story.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:10.370
That’s because if we’re being honest,
Muichiro is one of THE STRONGEST Hashira.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:15.640
So with him around Hantengu might not even
have time for his personalities to combine

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:21.579
into their ultimate form before Muichiro or
Tanjiro cut the head off of his actual body.

00:11:21.579 --> 00:11:27.420
So with one Upper Moon Demon down, they head
back into the village to find it COMPLETELY

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.269
COVERED IN ICE.

00:11:29.269 --> 00:11:30.269
Uh-oh.

00:11:30.269 --> 00:11:34.931
Unfortunately, they find random demons still
attacking the village AND WORST OF ALL, Demon

00:11:34.931 --> 00:11:41.560
Giyu is standing over the dead body of Mitsuri
with his demonic tail covering her body.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:42.560
Whew…

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.560
Okay.

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:45.050
No more sympathy for Giyu.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:47.110
He needs to DIE.

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.110
NOW!

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:52.529
Because while you might say he was forced
to become a demon and then blackmailed into

00:11:52.529 --> 00:11:57.420
eating humans, at this point I think he has
completely lost his humanity.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:02.350
Which is tragic because even though I think
Tanjiro would still try to turn Giyu into

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:07.490
a good demon, there is no chance of it working
now.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:13.110
Which means that OF COURSE they will have
to fight, and honestly there are many ways

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:14.820
that this battle could go.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:21.360
Giyu’s Blood Demon art is BROKEN with his
icy blade and his ability to even freeze people’s

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:27.399
blood somewhat, but I think Tanjiro and especially
Muichiro at this point would be strong enough

00:12:27.399 --> 00:12:29.040
to resist that.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:32.600
Although it is honestly hard to say if they
would win or not.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:38.330
I mean like I said Muichiro is EXTREMELY STRONG
with some of the best feats in the original

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.330
story.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:44.570
I would definitely put him above human Giyu,
but as a demon it is harder to say.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:49.269
Nonetheless though, it is nearly impossible
to say who would actually win this fight,

00:12:49.269 --> 00:12:55.370
but without a doubt it would be a DEVASTATING
BATTLE both physically and EMOTIONALLY for

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.370
Tanjiro.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:01.760
However, one thing that would make the fight
WAY EASIER for the heroes is if they actually

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:05.240
had another strong demon to fight on their
side.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.389
Who am I talking about?

00:13:06.389 --> 00:13:11.300
Well, in this altered timeline it is also
possible that Rengoku ACTUALLY AGREED to become

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:16.520
a demon during the Mugen Train Arc, and if
you want to see Demon Rengoku’s UNBELIEVABLE

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:21.889
POWERS and his heartbreaking sacrifice in
that version of the story, you can watch this

00:13:21.889 --> 00:13:22.889
video right here.

00:13:22.889 --> 00:13:25.759
Thanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

